    "Classification of protein families": "蛋白家族分类",
    "InterPro provides functional analysis of proteins by classifying them into families and predicting domains and important sites. To classify proteins in this way, InterPro uses predictive models, known as signatures, provided by several different databases (referred to as member databases) that make up the InterPro consortium. We combine protein signatures from these member databases into a single searchable resource, capitalising on their individual strengths to produce a powerful integrated database and diagnostic tool.": "InterPro 通过将蛋白归入家族、预测结构域与重要位点，对蛋白进行功能分析。为此，InterPro 使用由组成 InterPro 联盟的多个数据库（即成员数据库）提供的预测模型（称为签名）。我们将这些成员数据库的蛋白签名整合为单一可检索资源，发挥各自的优势，形成强大的集成数据库与诊断工具。",
    "If you use InterPro and/or Pfam, please cite our latest publications:": "如果你使用 InterPro 和/或 Pfam，请引用我们最新的出版物：",
    "Tools & libraries": "工具与库",
    "InterProScan is a software package designed to scan protein or nucleotide sequences against InterPro's member database signatures.": "InterProScan 是一个软件包，用于将蛋白或核苷酸序列与 InterPro 成员数据库的签名进行比对。",
    "A new API for InterPro": "InterPro 的新 API",
    "You can now skip URL and use this JSON interface to work with your data directly. Currently there are 6 main endpoints: entry, protein, structure, taxonomy, proteome and set.": "现在可以跳过 URL，直接使用这个 JSON 接口处理你的数据。目前有 6 个主要端点：entry、protein、structure、taxonomy、proteome 与 set。",
    "Nigthtingale is a monorepo containing visualisation web components, including the formerly known Protvista, a powerful and blazing-fast tool for handling protein sequence visualisation in the browser. ProtVista has been developed by UniProt.": "Nightingale 是一个包含可视化 Web 组件的 monorepo，其中包括原先的 Protvista —— 一个用于在浏览器中处理蛋白序列可视化的强大而快速的工具。ProtVista 由 UniProt 开发。",
