  "templates": [
    {
      "pat": "This website requires cookies, and the limited processing of your personal data in order to function. By using the site you are agreeing to this as outlined in our {{1}} and {{2}}.",
      "zh": "本网站需要 Cookie，并会对你的个人数据做有限处理才能正常运行。使用本网站即表示你同意我们在{{1}}与{{2}}中所述的内容。"
    },
    {
      "pat": "We're pleased to announce the {{1}}, describing the latest generation of our sequence analysis pipeline.",
      "zh": "我们很高兴地宣布{{1}}，它描述了我们序列分析流程的最新一代。"
    },
    {
      "pat": "This sequence includes matches predicted by ✨{{1}}, an AI-powered deep learning model developed by Google DeepMind.{{2}}By default, InterPro matches are supplemented with novel InterPro‑N predictions (novel matches or those at least 5% longer).{{3}}To change the display mode, open the {{4}} menu below and select your preferred setting. See {{5}} for an explanation of each display mode. If you use InterPro-N predictions, please include {{6}} in your references.",
      "zh": "本序列包含由 ✨{{1}} 预测的匹配，它是 Google DeepMind 开发的 AI 深度学习模型。{{2}}默认情况下，InterPro 匹配会补充新的 InterPro‑N 预测（新匹配或长度至少多 5%）。{{3}}要更改显示模式，请打开下方的 {{4}} 菜单并选择你偏好的设置。各显示模式的说明见{{5}}。若你使用 InterPro-N 预测，请在参考文献中附上{{6}}。"
    }
